====== NETGEAR WAX220 ======

{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

The NETGEAR WAX220 is a WiFi 6 802.11ax capable Access Point. It has a dual band 2x2 2.4 GHz radio, 3x3 5 GHz radio. It can be powered via PoE+ (802.3at) and has a single 2.5 Gbps Ethernet port.

